/*
 * test_stuffit_corpus.cpp - Desktop regression tests for classic StuffIt inputs.
 *
 * Loads committed JSON manifests generated by android/generate-stuffit-corpus-manifests.ps1
 * using desktop-side unar, then compares our listing and extraction behavior against them.
 */

